ntNumber":"376678999584005","timeOfActivity":"15:37:44","accountCategoryTypeCode":"CARD"},{"note":"A QUE SE DEDICA? TH ES COMERCIANTE, VENDE BEBIDAS Y TIENE EMPRESA DE TRANSPORTE , SUS INGRESOS SON MUY VARIABLES, NO TIENE FECHA ESPECIFICA EL CUAL RECIBE SUS INGRESOS, PUEDE CAERLE EN CUALQUIER DIA DEL MES MATRIZ: FAMILIAR, PRESTAMO CON BANCO, TRASPASO DE SALDO, PAGO DE RENTA, VENTA D E ALGUN BIEN EPAY: MENCIONA QUE YA CANCELO SU CTA SANTANDER, NO TIENE MAS CTAS NEGOCIACION: TH CONFIRMA PAGO DE 31K EN EFECTIVO EL DIA LUNES 18-10 EN EFECTIVO Y PAGO EN TARJETA LENDING MAS TARDAR EN FLP //ENTERADO DE SOBREGIRO EN AMBAS C","updateDate":"2021-10-16","activityTypeCode":"DE","accountNumber":"376678999584005","timeOfActivity":"15:37:44","accountCategoryTypeCode":"CARD"},{"note":"TAS Y BLOQUEO","updateDate":"2021-10-16","partyContactCode":"B","activityTypeCode":"IC","accountNumber":"376678999584005","timeOfActivity":"15:37:44","accountCategoryTypeCode":"CARD"},{"updateDate":"2021-10-16","activityTypeCode":"EN","accountNumber":"376678999584005","timeOfActivity":"15:31:24","accountCategoryTypeCode":"CARD"},{"updateDate":"2021-10-16","activityTypeCode":"EN","accountNumber":"376678999584005","timeOfActivity":"15:31:24","accountCategoryTypeCode":"CARD"},{"note":"DOCUMENT  ADD   PAYMENT FOR INACTIVE ACCOUNT 370784165683005 CCR ID XDKP ELECTRONIC PAYMENT FOR  $140784.29 PAYMENT DATE 07/10 WAS TAKEN ON 07/10/2021","updateDate":"2021-10-08","activityTypeCode":"DE","accountNumber":"376678999584005","timeOfActivity":"00:08:18","accountCategoryTypeCode":"CARD"},{"updateDate":"2026-10-11","activityTypeCode":"RI","accountNumber":"376669397182005","timeOfActivity":"01:45:25","accountCategoryTypeCode":"CARD"},{"note":"Account referred O/A","updateDate":"2026-10-11","activityTypeCode":"RV","accountNumber":"376669397182005","timeOfActivity":"01:45:25","accountCategoryTypeCode":"CARD"},{"note":"Account was placed O/A","updateDate":"2026-10-11","activityTypeCode":"RR","accountNumber":"37666939718